\item[* name:] Rlocadvvar
\item[* relevant examples:] x1 estar x2 $\rightarrow$ x1 estar all\'{\i}
\item[* language:] Spanish
\item[* kind of rule:] M-rule
\item[* subgrammar:] Verbppropformation
\item[* class:] rc advvarrules
\item[* date of creation:] 11-12-1987
